From 415a083a5dcc2ecb7e4eeafb8e2aef7086ebecb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhiyu722 <Zhiyu722@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 18:10:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 71/71] configs: enable DEBUG_FS, the one kernel-side gap the
 lc_main ROM hits

Analysis of the MIUI-port boot log (docs/lc_main-log-analysis.md) shows the
kernel init itself is not the problem -- it hands over to init in 0.96 s -- but
the ROM keeps failing on facilities the factory kernel does not provide:

  * netd: "Extension CONNMARK is not supported, missing kernel module?" x320,
    iptables error x107, retrying every 5 s for the whole capture
  * libprocessgroup: "controller schedtune is not found" x56 (no top-app boost)
  * lowmemorykiller: "Process reaping is not supported"
  * /sys/kernel/debug missing: init cannot copy ftrace_synthetic_events.conf,
    msm_vidc "Failed to create debugfs" x15, MIUI debug props denied

This tree already carries CONNMARK/NFLOG targets, schedtune, PSI, zram and the
Android LMK (verified on the device: /proc/net/ip_tables_targets lists CONNMARK
and NFLOG, /proc/cgroups lists schedtune, /proc/pressure exists), so swapping in
this kernel removes those three failure loops.  The one item that was missing
here too was CONFIG_DEBUG_FS, which both configs now enable (DEBUG_KERNEL and
FTRACE were already on) -- that also makes tracefs usable for our own debugging.

Signed-off-by: Zhiyu722 <Zhiyu722@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/h130_debug.config   |  2 +-
 arch/arm64/configs/h130_release.config |  2 +-
 docs/lc_main-log-analysis.md           | 79 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100755 docs/lc_main-log-analysis.md

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/h130_debug.config b/arch/arm64/configs/h130_debug.config
index 2cef9e856..659e65d30 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/h130_debug.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/h130_debug.config
@@ -5492,7 +5492,7 @@ CONFIG_FRAME_WARN=2048
 # CONFIG_READABLE_ASM is not set
 # CONFIG_UNUSED_SYMBOLS is not set
 # CONFIG_PAGE_OWNER is not set
-# CONFIG_DEBUG_FS is not set
+CONFIG_DEBUG_FS=y
 # CONFIG_HEADERS_CHECK is not set
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_SECTION_MISMATCH is not set
 CONFIG_SECTION_MISMATCH_WARN_ONLY=y
diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/h130_release.config b/arch/arm64/configs/h130_release.config
index b30ba9a98..60263fd18 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/h130_release.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/h130_release.config
@@ -5492,7 +5492,7 @@ CONFIG_FRAME_WARN=2048
 # CONFIG_READABLE_ASM is not set
 # CONFIG_UNUSED_SYMBOLS is not set
 # CONFIG_PAGE_OWNER is not set
-# CONFIG_DEBUG_FS is not set
